@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1/admin
@publicUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@setupKey = replace-with-your-setup-key
@token = paste-jwt-here

### 查询初始化状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/setup/status

### 创建初始管理员
POST {{baseUrl}}/setup/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "replace-with-strong-password",
  "setupKey": "{{setupKey}}"
}

### 登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "replace-with-strong-password"
}

### 当前管理员
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 仪表盘统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 前台访问上报（同一 visitorId 每个 UTC 日期只记录一次）
POST {{publicUrl}}/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visitorId": "7a9e4c72-b061-4ee6-9ed8-d986dbd6c919",
  "path": "/",
  "pageTitle": "首页"
}

### 修改密码
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "replace-with-strong-password",
  "newPassword": "replace-with-another-strong-password"
}
